 \"我希望的是他不是共享变量，每一次的启动都是一个单独的变量的\"\n   - \"我想的是每一次的命令启动都是一个单独的 claude_tap_plus进程的。里面的对象是隔离的，不是共享的\"\n   - \"是main.go里面的方法rp变量共享了\"\n   - \"hook没有错的，第一次... 对得上，然后第二次... 注册这里的session_id... 最后/exit命令调用后端接口是... 这一段的，还有就是Resume这段是main.go里面的\"\n   - \"是main.go里面的方法rp变量共享了\"\n   - (Provided definitive backend log showing trace-init bound to wrong pid=26292 instead of pid=17600)\n   - \"这里存在一个问题就是在trace_init的时候在同一个pid里面去了，不是根据session_id来的，应该是一个个session_id 一个proxy的\"\n   - \"如果不存在session_id的时候呢？？你这样做，如果没有session_id的时候直接启动的时候会不会收到影响的呢？\"\n   - \"还有两个场景，就是先有--resume，后是没有，还有一个就是先没有后有--resume的场景的\"\n   - \"设计成串行启动的呢？？或者预设表示为，在内部添加一个表示的去进行pid的匹配的可以完成么？\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Fix the trace-init routing issue so each proxy only receives its own session's trace-init\n   - User is evaluating two approaches: (1) serial startup design, (2) internal identifier for PID matching\n   - No code changes have been successfully applied yet\n\n8. Current Work:\n   User asked about two alternative design approaches for the fix:\n   - \"设计成串行启动的呢\" — design as serial/sequential startup (ensure only one proxy runs at a time)\n   - \"预设表示为，在内部添加一个表示的去进行pid的匹配的可以完成么\" — pre-set an identifier internally in the proxy for PID matching during trace-init routing\n   \n   The conversation was at the point of evaluating which approach to implement. The guard approach (reject trace-init if p.sessionID already set) was confirmed to handle all 4 scenarios, but user wants to consider these alternative approaches before committing to a fix.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Respond to user's question about the two alternative approaches:\n   1. **Serial startup**: Ensure only one proxy runs at a time - analyze feasibility and implications\n   2. **Internal PID matching identifier**: Add an internal identifier to the proxy that gets included in trace-init routing - analyze how this would work with the backend's existing routing logic\n   \n   User's exact question: \"设计成串行启动的呢？？或者预设表示为，在内部添加一个表示的去进行pid的匹配的可以完成