","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n## Comprehensive Shared Data Points Map\n\nBased on my thorough search, here's the complete map of all shared data points in the claude-hk project:\n\n### 1. **Config Files that Bridge `.claude/` and `claude_tap_plus/`**\n\n#### **`~/.claude-tap-plus/backend.json`**\n- **Purpose**: Backend service connection configuration\n- **Format**: JSON with `host` and `port` fields\n- **Who writes**: Go backend (WriteBackendInfo function)\n- **Who reads**: \n  - Go backend (autostart logic)\n  - Shell hooks (.claude/lib/config.sh via load_backend_config)\n- **Isolation**: Global (single file shared by all processes)\n\n#### **`~/.claude-tap-plus/profiles.json`**\n- **Purpose**: API client configuration (base URLs, auth tokens)\n- **Format**: JSON with profiles (default, glm, kimi)\n- **Who writes**: Go client (config/profiles.go)\n- **Who reads**: Go client (config/client.go)\n- **Isolation**: Global (single file shared by all Go processes)\n\n### 2. **File-based State in `.claude/`**\n\n#### **`.claude/.initialized`**\n- **Purpose**: Initialization marker\n- **Format**: JSON with OS, python, timestamp\n- **Who writes**: Shell init.sh\n- **Who reads**: Shell init.sh (exits if already initialized)\n- **Isolation**: Global (per-project marker)\n\n#### **`.claude/skills/.active`**\n- **Purpose**: Currently active skill tracking\n- **Format**: `skill_id|skill_name` per line\n- **Who writes**: Shell skill management\n- **Who reads**: Shell skill loading logic\n- **Isolation**: Per-process (single active skill)\n\n#### **`.claude/skills/registry.conf`**\n- **Purpose**: Available skills registry\n- **Format**: One skill name per line\n- **Who writes**: Static file\n- **Who reads**: Shell skill-inject.sh\n- **Isolation**: Static (read-only)\n\n#### **`.claude/hooks/logs/YYYY-MM-DD.log`**\n- **Purpose**: Hook execution logs\n- **Format**: Timestamped log entries\n- **Who writes**: All hooks (via init logging)\n- **Who reads**: