[string]string` - pid → proxy_url\n  - `sessions: map[string]string` - session_id → proxy_url\n  - `proxySessions: map[string][]string` - pid → session_ids\n- **Purpose**: Runtime proxy registration and session routing\n- **Isolation**: Per-backend-process (lost on restart)\n\n#### **ReasoningCache (proxy/reasoning_cache.go)**\n- **Protected by**: `sync.RWMutex`\n- **Data structures**:\n  - `full: map[string]string` - content+tool_calls → reasoning\n  - `toolcall: map[string]string` - tool_calls → reasoning\n  - `lastValue: string` - recent cache\n- **Purpose**: Cache API reasoning content for multi-round conversations\n- **Isolation**: Per-proxy-instance\n\n### 6. **SQLite Tables (Persistent Shared State)**\n\n#### **`backend.db`** database contains:\n\n1. **`machines` table**\n   - Machine ID, OS, hostname, username\n   - First/last seen timestamps\n   - **Purpose**: Track which machines have used the system\n\n2. **`projects` table**\n   - Project slug, CWD\n   - First/last seen timestamps\n   - **Purpose**: Track which projects have been worked on\n\n3. **`sessions` table**\n   - Session ID, machine ID, project info\n   - Transcript paths, status, timestamps\n   - **Purpose**: Track Claude Code sessions\n\n4. **`issue_claims` table**\n   - GitHub issue repo/number\n   - Status (idle/claimed/released)\n   - Session ID, timestamps\n   - **Purpose**: Track issue ownership across sessions\n\n5. **`config` table**\n   - Key-value pairs with timestamps\n   - **Purpose**: Runtime configuration storage\n\n6. **`proxies` table**\n   - Proxy ID, project slug\n   - Status, registration timestamps\n   - **Purpose**: Persistent proxy registry\n\n### 7. **HTTP Endpoints (Shared State Interface)**\n\nAll endpoints are under `/api/`:\n- **Issue endpoints**: `/api/issue/*` - Issue management\n- **Session endpoints**: `/api/session/*` - Session lifecycle\n- **Proxy endpoints**: `/api/proxy/*` - Proxy registration & routing\n- **Machine endpoints**: `/api/machines` - Machine listing\n- **Project endpoints**: `/api/projects` - Project listing\n- **Log endpoints**: `/api/logs` - Log querying\n- **Config endpoints**: `/api/config` - Configuration\n- **Status endpoints**: `/api/status` - System status\n\n### 8. **Shared Files Between Concurrent Proxy Instances**\n\n#### **`~/.claude-tap-plus/proxy.json`**\n- **Critical shared state**: All proxy instances register/unregister here\n- **Concurrency**: Protected by file-level mutex in Go\n- **Purpose**: Enables backend to route trace-init requests to correct proxy\n\n#### **Trace directories**\n- **Pattern**: `~/.claude-tap-plus/.traces/YYYY-MM-DD/session_id/`\n- **Concurrency**: Each proxy writes to separate directories\n- **Note**: No conflicts as paths include session IDs\n\n### Key Insights:\n\n1. **Primary shared state file**: `proxy.json` is the most critical shared file between multiple proxy instances\n2. **Backend coordination**: The backend service maintains in-memory proxy routing that's backed by persistent storage\n3. **Session isolation**: Most state is isolated by session ID (project_slug_session_id)\n4. **Race condition protection**: Go code uses mutexes for in-memory state; file operations are serialized\n5. **Bridge files**: `backend.json` and `proxy.json` are the main bridge points between shell and Go code\n6. **No PID files**: The design uses JSON registration rather than simple PID files\n7. **Global state**: Configuration files (backend.json, profiles.json) are global and shared by all processes"}],"totalDurationMs":163265,"totalTokens":70520,"totalToolUseCount":32,"usage":{"input_tokens":361,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":67302,"output_tokens":2857,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":14,"searchCount":15,"bashCount":3,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_b80edc92390c487e9d8e44d4","duration_ms":163265}
