[2026-06-07 19:12:34] [INFO] [PreToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"5a952b88-dbcf-40a5-820e-fed7478f0486","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\5a952b88-dbcf-40a5-820e-fed7478f0486.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus","permission_mode":"auto","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Agent","tool_input":{"description":"Verify current changes on disk","prompt":"I need to verify the current state of several files that were modified in this conversation. The changes are about simplifying trace-init routing by using `CLAUDE_TAP_PROXY_PID` environment variable injected by the proxy into child processes, removing machine+project affinity routing and broadcast probing.\n\nPlease check these files and report their current state (what's been changed, what's correct, what still needs fixing):\n\n1. `D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/main.go` — should have `CLAUDE_TAP_PROXY_PID` env var injection after `BuildChildEnv` call (around line 330)\n\n2. `D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/proxy_handler.go` — should have been simplified: no `machineProject` map, no affinity routing, no broadcast. Only PID-based routing with `proxy_pid` required.\n\n3. `D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/api/request.go` — `TraceInitRequest` should only have `SessionID`, `ProxyPID`, `TranscriptPath` (no `MachineID`, `ProjectSlug`)\n\n4. `D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/.claude/hooks/01-session-start/base.sh` — should read `CLAUDE_TAP_PROXY_PID` env var as primary PID source, fallback to `.init-pid` file. Should NOT send `machine_id`/`project_slug` in trace-init request. Should skip if no PID available.\n\n5. `D:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk/claude_tap_plus/internal/proxy/reverse.go` — check `handleTraceInit` to see if it still references